32
00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:18.539
Now, what we need to do next is actually activate our cloth paint and create our first bit of clothing simulation.

33
00:03:18.539 --> 00:03:24.539
And to do that, we will right click on our LOD zero and create clothing data from section.

34
00:03:24.539 --> 00:03:30.539
And then from the little menu that pops up, we're going to leave everything default and we'll just hit create.

35
00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:39.060
Then once we're done with that, we will need to apply our clothing data and that is going to give us the simulation started.

36
00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:41.060
So let's just pop back over here to the editor.

37
00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:48.060
So we need to right click on our clothing and we need to create clothing data from section.

38
00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:54.060
So we're going to create then we need to right click on it again and then we need to apply that clothing data.

